created: undefined, last updated: 2026-07-28, [Read more](https://bun.com/docs/guides/ecosystem/tanstack-start)

Modify the scripts field in your `package.json` by prefixing the Vite CLI commands with `bun --bun`.
This ensures that Bun executes the Vite CLI for common tasks like `dev`, `build`, and `preview`.
```json package.json icon="file-json" theme={"theme":{"light":"github-light","dark":"dracula"}}
